LM393P Stage 1 - RC oscillator, PWM threshold, amplitude potentiometer
* TI LM393 macromodel from installed NI Multisim master database LM393/TI.
* U1A: DIP pins IN+=3 IN-=2 V+=8 GND=4 OUT=1
* U1B: DIP pins IN+=5 IN-=6 V+=8 GND=4 OUT=7
V5 V5 0 5
CDEC V5 0 100n
CBULK V5 0 10u
RPU1 V5 OSC 2.2k
RHT V5 HYST 30k
RHB HYST 0 10k
RHF OSC HYST 20k
RFIX OSC FSET 22k
RVRF FSET RAMP 15288.86443
CT RAMP 0 1n
XU1A HYST RAMP V5 0 OSC LM393_TI
* VDUTY resistor chain: 10k + 10k potentiometer + 4.7k.
RDT V5 DUTY_TOP 10k
RVDT DUTY_TOP DUTY 9114.335047
RVDB DUTY DUTY_BOT 885.6649532
RDB DUTY_BOT 0 4.7k
XU1B DUTY RAMP V5 0 PWM_RAW LM393_TI
RPU2 V5 PWM_RAW 2.2k
* 20k amplitude potentiometer, wiper at V1, includes specified load.
RVAT PWM_RAW V1 15460.74811
RVAB V1 0 4539.251886
RINPUT V1 0 1000000
CINPUT V1 0 15p
